jpg" style="width: 100%; display: block;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 style="line-height: normal; font-weight: 700; margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 20px !important;"&gt;世界上的山脉都是定时炸弹&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: 1.4; margin: 12px 0 0 0; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important;"&gt;从使徒保罗到艾拉·格什温，几千年来，山脉一直是不可动摇的稳定的象征。地球变暖正在破坏这一点，导致山体滑坡、洪水和雪崩。周三尼泊尔和中国西藏地区边境发生山洪后出现的世界末日景象是可能造成的破坏的最新例子。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 40px; text-align: center; line-height: 40px; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px !important;"&gt;阅读更多&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;你的零听&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #f5f5f5; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/IS6m3xb5HKZ3Yk3UH1411NzpR59I27z2G-FPXw0LBhJDMCZBovaCJ2yrLRPwOXRvkiU4zE8mJ31pIOyQWbTX_ezt6lKju5Qeey4zxPlBXh9kAIGUT91TgDSCUBp05VsQBANarWkroFIWDU1orBFwbtAyUfs3o4JgY6xzjPT_ihylhF-6YMEfFhF-WsTmXkJD6Z7MSgCqTv8Sum7GBhyQT3YW3WudYUE_CWTi3FzlRr3HWl5xT0rpgbnnTN59F9Gy6bBmuz4pNVqX0lS--1nRUZmKVw46r1bz9VRUXHTbmCYDUj1YE2w7NzwLc5PkCrn2uaH7frigjjb1gVRUzB_adwx5AoPQDnbMWzyibldYn_wSAJKXtttABmFTPxomZ5biUnDAOcLqnzOwuZgTt4SlaRO4-GCTQineEvJE0ziEi3Ld5qmYNlGqfvLfawlPUayuDD_fxCuo0tpAf47gJArSMv40e_ED8ukfFXwWIOCDRR3TBtHwne5QP_Yt1CfpmTrVouUF4qXHpcb0sbow14UEw43PrLQBfqpFfavTyw/RXRooiPH6M79oFGwzqOIhnyHT-O6Qt2E/24" style="font-size: inherit; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;" width="100%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden;" valign="top" width="80"&gt;&lt;img alt="零" height="80" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iGGOhKVVdYEo/v12/-1x-1.png" style="display: block; border-radius: